# ==============================================================================
# JevDash Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================

# [Option 1] Vercel AI Gateway Key (Recommended for live Jev inference)
# Get your key from: https://vercel.com/ai-gateway
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=your_vercel_ai_gateway_key_here

# [Option 2] Native TypeSafe API Key (Direct TypeSafe SDK access)
# Get your key from: https://typesafe.ai
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=your_typesafe_api_key_here

# Note: If no API key is provided, JevDash will automatically run in high-performance
# simulated Mock mode with zero external dependencies and 100% stage clear capability.
